        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-gray-200">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Milwaukee for trades, DeWalt for breadth and availability, Makita for refinement and long days, Ryobi for homeowners. Those four cover the overwhelming majority of buyers, and the honest ranking depends entirely on which of those descriptions fits you.
          </p>
          <p class="m-0">
            Whichever you pick, pick one and stay with it. A platform you have committed to and built out beats a marginally better platform you own three tools from, every time.
